## 7) Providers WhatsApp soportados

### 7.1 Meta Cloud API
- Endpoints:
  - `POST /meta-webhook`
  - `POST /whatsapp-webhook` (alias)
- Requiere token y phone_number_id.

### 7.2 Gupshup
